WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.402 align:start size:78% position:22%
- Hello, I'm Gav.
- I'm Dan.

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:05.038 align:start position:0%
We're the Slow Mo guys,
and over the last seven years,

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:06.706 align:start position:0%
Dan, I feel like we've been
rather confined

00:00:06.739 --> 00:00:08.541 align:start position:0%
to the boundaries
of my back garden.

00:00:08.574 --> 00:00:10.243 align:start size:59% position:41%
Yeah, not much room
for explosions.

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:12.378 align:start size:63% position:38%
You know, neighbors,
lots of noise.
Not the best.

00:00:12.411 --> 00:00:16.315 align:start position:0%
Right. So we've been able to
convince YouTube to fly us both
out to L.A.

00:00:16.348 --> 00:00:19.752 align:start position:0%
in order to pursue
some of our dream projects
for the next 12 weeks.

00:00:19.785 --> 00:00:22.121 align:start size:69% position:31%
But to differentiate
from our usual videos,

00:00:22.154 --> 00:00:24.290 align:start size:97% position:3%
and because we're obviously
very creative at naming things,

00:00:24.323 --> 00:00:27.327
this is "The Super Slow Show."

00:00:31.263 --> 00:00:34.267
<i> ( music playing )</i>

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:37.770
Both: Whoa.

00:00:37.803 --> 00:00:39.639 align:start size:88% position:13%
- Look at that ignition.
- Oh, wow.

00:00:39.672 --> 00:00:42.075
Gav:<i> For the next 12 weeks,
 we'll be releasing</i>

00:00:42.108 --> 00:00:44.177
48 different videos
featuring some stunts...

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:46.212
( grunting )

00:00:51.183 --> 00:00:54.687 align:start size:97% position:3%
- ( groaning )
- It looks almost too graphic
  to show.

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:57.824
And slow motion we could never
pull off in our back garden.

00:00:57.857 --> 00:01:00.693
That's ridiculous.
That's really cool, man.

00:01:00.726 --> 00:01:02.862
That's ridiculous.

00:01:02.895 --> 00:01:06.399
Never believed in someone more
than I believe in Tony Hawk
in this moment.

00:01:06.432 --> 00:01:08.435
<i> ( music playing )</i>

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:13.306 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Yeah, you just stood
  in mid-air.
- Just walking on air.

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:15.641
Dan:
You just stood in mid-air
with your hand out.

00:01:15.674 --> 00:01:18.377
Because different subjects
require different speeds,

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:21.848
we have an absolute army
of Phantoms ready to go.

00:01:21.881 --> 00:01:23.850
We got a new set.
We got a crew.

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:25.785
Here we got a slide.
New lab coats.

00:01:25.818 --> 00:01:28.488
<i> We got a green room
 for celebrity guests.</i>

00:01:28.521 --> 00:01:31.624
<i> We got a pool.</i>

00:01:31.657 --> 00:01:33.493
<i> We've got a spinner.</i>

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:35.895
- Whoa, geez!
- Oh, god!

00:01:35.928 --> 00:01:39.298
Is that one of our heads?
Just rolled on the floor there.

00:01:39.331 --> 00:01:40.766
<i> Hold on.</i>

00:01:40.799 --> 00:01:42.735
<i> We've got a dropper.</i>

00:01:42.768 --> 00:01:44.871
( grunts )

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:47.540 align:start size:72% position:28%
- Ooh.
- ( laughter )

00:01:47.573 --> 00:01:50.543 align:start size:53% position:47%
More importantly,
new lab coats.

00:01:50.576 --> 00:01:52.411 align:start size:38% position:63%
Oh, come on!

00:01:52.444 --> 00:01:55.448
<i> ( "Ode To Joy" playing )</i>

00:02:13.232 --> 00:02:17.336
<i> Oh, look at you.
 Look at you.</i>

00:02:17.369 --> 00:02:20.373
<i> ( music playing )</i>

00:02:20.406 --> 00:02:21.807
( horn blaring )

